SUMMARY:New Moon Night Hike
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\n**Saturday
 \, Oct. 10\, 7:30-9:45 p.m.: A New Moon Night Hike.** A roughly four-mile 
 hike with some uphill grades and moderate pace touching all four "quadrant
 s" of the reservation below Northfield Avenue. For ages 15+. Bring a flash
 light or headlamp as it will be very dark: sunset is at 6:23 p.m. and ther
 e will be no visible moon. **Meet at:** Painter's Point off Brookside Driv
 e. 1.0 mile south of South Orange Avenue\, 0.9 miles north of Glen Avenue.
  **Leader:** Dennis Percher\, 973-868-6994
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/somocon/events/316848971/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261005T041415Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261005T041415Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
